slimevolley (2.4.2+dfsg-3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Team upload.
  * Fix FTBFS with GCC 10. (Closes: #957813)
  * Update Standards-Version to 4.5.0:
    - Switch priority from extra to optional
    - Drop obsolete menu file
    - Declare that d/rules does not require root
  * Update debhelper compat level to 13:
    - Drop --parallel, as it is default
  * Enable all hardening options.
  * Import repository to salsa and set Vcs-* fields.
  * Switch upstream URLs to https.
  * Remove trailing whitespace.
  * Mark slimevolley-data as Multi-Arch: foreign.

